# Personal Website — $0-Cost Project Rules

## Project Identity
- **Name**: Personal Website (free_website)
- **Goal**: $0/month personal site — no paid services, ever
- **Domain**: Hostinger (already owned)
- **Repo**: GitHub
- **Hosting**: Cloudflare Pages (free tier)

## Tech Stack
| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Framework | Astro (latest stable) |
| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v3 |
| Database + Auth | Supabase (free tier) |
| CI/CD | GitHub → Cloudflare Pages |
| Domain | Hostinger DNS → Cloudflare Pages |

## Features in Scope
- Blog (markdown-based, static generation)
- Notes (personal notes, Supabase DB)
- Small browser games (client-side only, scores in Supabase)
- Projects showcase
- Google login (via Supabase Auth)
- User profiles
- Bookmarks / reading progress
- Game scores / leaderboard
- Future monetization hooks (no paid infra added until needed)

## 🔴 ABSOLUTE RULES — Never Violate
1. **$0/month constraint** — see `01-zero-cost-guard.mdc`
2. **Supabase RLS is mandatory** on every table — see `03-security.mdc`
3. **Never expose secrets** — `.env` never committed, use Cloudflare env vars
4. **Mobile-first** — all UI starts at 320px wide, scales up
5. **No unnecessary dependencies** — check `package.json` before adding any package
6. **Ask before adding any service** — verify free tier, document limits

